{'symbol': 'WBA', 'date': '2021-09-10 11:00:00', 'title': 'BLUE SHIELD OF CALIFORNIA, WALGREENS COLLABORATE TO BRING INNOVATIVE HEALTHCARE AND WELLNESS SERVICES TO COMMUNITIES IN GOLDEN STATE', 'text': 'OAKLAND, CALIF., SEPT. 10, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BLUE SHIELD OF CALIFORNIA AND WALGREENS TODAY ANNOUNCED A NEW COLLABORATION TO EXPAND ACCESS TO HEALTH CARE, LOWER COSTS, AND BRING INNOVATIVE SERVICES TO ENHANCE THE CONSUMER EXPERIENCE FOR INDIVIDUALS, FAMILIES, AND COMMUNITIES THROUGHOUT CALIFORNIA.'}